        </div>
        <div class="pain-list reveal">
          <article class="pain-card"><div class="pain-top"><span class="pain-ico"><i class="ph ph-wallet" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><b>01</b></div><h3>Biaya Travel Terlalu Mahal</h3><p>Ingin berangkat bersama keluarga, tapi terkendala budget paket travel konvensional yang makin mahal.</p><span class="pain-sol"><i class="ph ph-check-circle" aria-hidden="true"></i>Solusinya: Bab 5–6: tiket hemat &amp; hotel</span></article>
